   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Oh My Dear Falling in Love**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **The Goin Gets Tough From the Getgo**: back after 121 archived shows (3600 days); rare: 9 archived performances [4]\n- **The Stallion Part 5**: rare: 9 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2020-02-14** (recommended): source not stated; 29 songs; 146 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer says the venue was actually Terminal 5 in New York, not Terminal West, which is in Atlanta [2]\n- Reviewer attended and says it was their last concert before New York shut down [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2020-02-14**: taped by Rich Cuiffo; transferred by WeenBandit; source: Schoeps MK41s > Nbob actives > Nbox Platinum (ABS) > Zoom H6 DPA 4061's > Core Sound Battery Box > Zoom H6 [1]",
